<title>HONG KONG: JCG Holdings 1996 year net up 43.5 pct.</title>
<headline>JCG Holdings 1996 year net up 43.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   54.8   vs 47.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    18.0   vs 14.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    391.83 vs 273.13</p>
<p>    Company name		 JCG Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 14-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 8</p>
<p>NOTE - JCG Holdings owns JCG Finance Co, a deposit-taking company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 25 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of seven cents) vs 21 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6468</p>
</text>
